# (build 163) The retranslation in battle: formation 1 (fight's), FIGHT,
# victory. His battle box (battle_box): the dialogue window's width, 24
# cells at columns 7-32 -- the stock box is 20 at 9-30 -- its left border
# at x 60, where the stock box shows the floor. Each victory line fits one
# line, so the box has one. {char} is Rolf's name, his default: Eusis.
start battle 1
language retranslation
wait idle                    # FIGHT / STGY
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
expect script $1211
expect text "Eusis and the others won!"
expect pixel 60 150 $EEE           # the box's left border
expect pixel 64 152 $EEE           # the top of the E
shot 01_victory
press c
wait idle
expect text "Got 5 experience points!"
press c
wait idle
expect text "Got 15 meseta!"
shot 02_meseta
press c
wait screen level
